# Conformance probe pack for ruling 1 of 0.56: a `group` on the member of a
# `null` field comes before `null`, with the field line first. Public. No kinds.
format  conformance-null-056-2
version 0.56.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   probe.s1     m  string  null
group   probe.items  m
  field  probe.label  name  string
  field  probe.qty    q     int
end
